{%- comment -%}
  The /HCL-ML end rail: the robotics portfolio. The card lists the projects
  straight from _data/robotics.yml so it never goes stale.

  This is the one place the main site links to /robotics/ — the never-link
  rule in docs/claude/robotics-ml-portfolio.md is about the public personal
  site; /HCL-ML is an orphan, gated page shared with the same audience the
  portfolio is built for (Chris, 2026-08-21).
{%- endcomment -%}
<nav class="hcl-ends" aria-label="read next">
  <p class="hcl-ends-lead">read next</p>
  <a class="hcl-end" href="{{ '/robotics/' | relative_url }}">
    <span class="hcl-end-k">portfolio</span>
    <span class="hcl-end-t">Robotics portfolio</span>
    <span class="hcl-end-d">{% for p in site.data.robotics.projects %}{{ p.title }}{% unless forloop.last %} · {% endunless %}{% endfor %}</span>
  </a>
</nav>
